    /// polling.
    ///
    /// [`event::Source`]: ./event/trait.Source.html
    /// [`readable`]: struct.Interest.html#associatedconstant.READABLE
    /// [`writable`]: struct.Interest.html#associatedconstant.WRITABLE
    /// [`iter`]: ./event/struct.Events.html#method.iter
